{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q12", "domain": "relationship", "question": "何时结婚？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字辛丑、庚子、丁酉、辛丑，日主丁火生于子月，七杀当令，财星庚辛重重，地支酉丑合金，全局金寒水冷，丁火孤立无根，身弱至极。婚姻以正财庚金为妻，妻宫酉金坐偏财，财多身弱，需待大运助身方能担财成婚。\n\n排定大运：阴年男命逆排，起运约8岁。大运为：己亥（8-17）、戊戌（18-27）、丁酉（28-37）、丙申（38-47）、乙未（48-57）等。在戊戌运（18-27岁），戌为火库，日主得根，伤官制杀，有结婚之机，尤其23岁后流年逢甲子、丙寅、丁卯等木火助力，身旺能任财官，姻缘当动。丁酉运（28-37岁）比肩帮身，妻宫伏吟，亦为婚期之兆。故婚期最有可能在23-32岁之间。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_19611230_P003-Q12", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1a_prime_R1_P3_G1\\details_2024_b1a_prime_R1_P3_G1.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 96442, "response_id": "c537d92d-0740-4cdc-8d90-7f737cf45863", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 208, "completion_tokens": 6251, "total_tokens": 6459, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 5997}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 80}}
{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q13", "domain": "career", "question": "有官非刑事出现的时间？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "命主八字为辛丑 庚子 丁酉 辛丑，日主丁火生于子月，七杀当令，地支酉丑合金，天干三金透出，财杀相生，全局气势在金水。丁火阴干，无根无生，唯有丑中余气，衰极而从，故为从弱格，喜金水湿土，忌木火燥土。\n\n大运逆排，约7岁8个月起运：己亥（8-18岁）、戊戌（18-28岁）、丁酉（28-38岁）、丙申（38-48岁）、乙未（48-58岁）。其中戊戌运，伤官透干，地支丑戌相刑激荡，戌为火库忌神，丁火得根破格，身弱而伤官见杀，刑冲并见，是典型的官非牢狱标志。流年遇壬戌（1982年，21岁），伤官见官，丑戌双刑；癸亥（1983年，22岁），伤官合杀，亥子丑会水局灭火。此两年官非刑事极高，正值13-22岁年龄段。其他大运或伏吟自刑，或印食冲害，凶险程度皆不及戊戌运之伤官见官与刑冲齐备。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_19611230_P003-Q13", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1a_prime_R1_P3_G1\\details_2024_b1a_prime_R1_P3_G1.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 96841, "response_id": "0d4f0175-7d3f-4685-9024-3b15d1704b03", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 214, "completion_tokens": 6436, "total_tokens": 6650, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 6142}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 86}}
{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q14", "domain": "unknown", "question": "有凶劫之灾出现的时间？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "命主八字为辛丑 庚子 丁酉 辛丑，日主丁火生于仲冬子月，金寒水冷，地支酉丑合金，子丑合水，全局财官强旺，丁火虚浮无根，只得从弱之势，以金水为喜，最忌木火生扶破格。\n\n分析各流年：\n- **1965乙巳年（4岁）**：尚未交大运，以月柱庚子为运。流年天干乙木被月干庚金合住，无法生助日主；地支巳火本为丁火帝旺之根，但与命局中酉、丑三合成金局，巳火贪合忘生，不但不能扶身，反而助旺财星，财又生杀，导致七杀无制疯狂攻身。日主得虚根即被合化，为破格大凶之兆，易有生死劫难。\n- 其余选项年份或顺旺势（辛亥），或制化得宜（戊申、甲寅合运），凶险程度皆不如此年。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_19611230_P003-Q14", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1a_prime_R1_P3_G1\\details_2024_b1a_prime_R1_P3_G1.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 46253, "response_id": "50f70aaf-7b21-42d4-9086-d38e7cfe479c", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 219, "completion_tokens": 2876, "total_tokens": 3095, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 2632}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 91}}
{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q15", "domain": "unknown", "question": "那个时段，破财最严重？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "### 推理分析\n\n1. **命盘解读**：\n   - 日主丁火，生于子月（仲冬），水旺火囚，坐下酉金耗身，年时柱辛丑土金，月柱庚子金水。\n   - 全局金寒水冷，丁火无根（地支无寅、午、巳、未中火根），无印星（木）生扶，构成**从财格**（从弱），以金水为用神，忌木火帮身破格。\n   - 财星庚辛金三透，又得子水七杀旺势，财气极盛，但日主极弱，必待大运不逆格局方可稳守财富。一旦大运逆势（行木火），则破格损财。\n\n2. **大运排布**：\n   - 阴年（辛）男命逆排，从月柱庚子起：己亥、戊戌、丁酉、**丙申**、**乙未**、**甲午**。\n   - 起运：出生（1961年12月30日）距上一节气大雪（12月7日）23天，3天折1岁，约7岁8个月起运（约1969年8月交运）。\n   - 大运时段：\n     - 8-17岁：己亥（顺遂，食神制杀）\n     - 18-27岁：戊戌（伤官燥土，略有逆势，但土生金尚可）\n     - **28-37岁：丁酉**（天干丁火比肩，地支酉金财，虚火夺财，小破财）\n     - **38-47岁：丙申**（劫财丙火坐申金，丙与三辛争合，财来财去，破财明显）\n     - **48-57岁：乙未**（偏印生身，未为大燥土克水冲丑，日主得库根，格局开始逆破）\n     - **58-67岁：甲午**（正印坐禄，丁火得午为强根，立刻破格，子午冲、火克酉金，财星大损）\n\n3. **选项对应时段与破财程度分析**：\n   - A（23-32岁）：戊戌运尾+丁酉运前半。丁酉运虽有比肩，但虚浮无根，破财轻微。\n   - B（33-42岁）：丁酉运尾+**丙申运**前半。丙辛合，劫财合财，破耗变大，但丙坐申金旺财，仍有一定来源。\n   - C（43-52岁）：丙申运尾+**乙未运**前半。乙未运印星得根，未冲丑，破格加重，破财明显。\n   - D（53-62岁）：乙未运尾+**甲午运**前半。甲午运日主得午火强根，彻底破格，子午遥冲激发水火之战，酉金受克，财星崩毁，是**从格最忌的大运**，此阶段破财最为严重，甚至有倾家之险。\n\n### 最终答案：\nD", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.5, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_19611230_P003-Q15", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1a_prime_R1_P3_G1\\details_2024_b1a_prime_R1_P3_G1.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 45340, "response_id": "43b42c58-e721-48b9-ab9a-0d1a55bd6c